@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@apiKey = dev-key

# DOC Intelligence - Trilha A | Fluxo completo (execute em ordem)

### 1) Health check
# @name step1Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
Accept: application/json

### 2) Upload PNG
# @name step2Upload
POST {{baseUrl}}/documents
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----DocIntelBoundary

------DocIntelBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="workflow-sample.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./fixtures/sample.png
------DocIntelBoundary--

### 3) Consultar status (id automático do passo 2)
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents/{{step2Upload.response.body.id}}
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

### 4) Reenviar mesmo arquivo (deduplicação)
POST {{baseUrl}}/documents
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----DocIntelBoundary

------DocIntelBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="workflow-sample.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./fixtures/sample.png
------DocIntelBoundary--

### 5) Listar documentos DONE
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents?status=DONE
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
Accept: application/json
